---
import MotifIcon from './MotifIcon.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/siteData';
---

<section class="section-frame contact-frame" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="container frame-container">
    <div class="frame-label">
      <p class="section-kicker">Contact</p>
      <h2 id="contact-title">お問い合わせ</h2>
      <div class="short-rule"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="frame-content contact-content">
      <div class="contact-copy">
        <p>お仕事のご相談・ご依頼など、お気軽にお問い合わせください。</p>
        <a class="mail-link" href={profile.contactHref}>
          <MotifIcon name="mail" />
          <span>{profile.email}</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-outline" href={profile.contactHref}>
        <span>お問い合わせフォームへ</span>
        <MotifIcon name="arrow" />
      </a>
      <MotifIcon name="sparkle" class="contact-sparkle" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
